os que eliminó a la mitad de la vida en el universo, los Vengadores supervivientes quedan devastados y divididos. Cinco años después, una inesperada oportunidad les permite intentar revertir la catástrofe. Reuniéndose una vez más, los héroes emprenden una misión extrema que los obliga a viajar al pasado, enfrentarse a sus propias pérdidas y hacer sacrificios definitivos para restaurar el equilibrio del universo.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Ciencia ficción","Acción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/299534","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2019,"updatedAt":"2026-10-19T13:17:27.288Z"},{"id":"movie-1462229","slug":"movie-1462229","title":"飞驰人生3","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fzkfI2LWgPEHiFOFW2JveqlAY3h.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1462229","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-19T13:17:27.567Z"},{"id":"movie-1003598","slug":"movie-1003598","title":"Vengadores: Secret Wars","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f0YBuh4hyiAheXhh4JnJWoKi9g5.jpg","synopsis":"Segunda de las dos películas de Los Vengadores para la Fase 6 del MCU.","status":"Planned","country":null,"genres":["Ciencia ficción","Acción","Aventura"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1003598","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2027,"updatedAt":"2026-10-19T13:17:27.842Z"},{"id":"movie-552524","slug":"movie-552524","title":"Lilo y Stitch","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4oLLOAT55JhAoe73VliaSKFvEEr.jpg","synopsis":"La conmovedora y divertidísima historia de una solitaria niña hawaiana y el extraterrestre fugitivo que la ayuda a reparar su desestructurada familia.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Familia","Ciencia ficción","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/552524","type":"flyflix","contentTyp